# Trained models — regenerate with `rasa train`. The one exception is the served
# model, kept so a fresh clone (and the Docker image) can run without retraining.
# Its NLU components are byte-identical to the model the final test evaluated
# (20261003-172117-obvious-link, still in the git history); only the dialogue
# layer differs.
models/*.tar.gz
models/*/
!models/20261004-141855-sparse-octagon.tar.gz

# Test and measurement output (`rasa test`, scripts/cv_*.py).
results/

